>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/compare/">Comparisons</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Comparison</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">NordicTrack vs ProForm</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Two badges, one parent company, one software platform. NordicTrack is the heavier, pricier line and ProForm the value line — but in the middle of the price range the badge matters far less than the specification underneath it.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
